    &= \Pr\left(\exists i \in [k] : r_i \in \bigcup_{j \in [k]} C(l_j) \hspace{0.8mm}\middle\vert\hspace{0.8mm} \|\bigcup_{j \in [k]} C(l_j)\| = z\right)\\
    &= \Pr_{p_1,\ldots,p_k \sim \textrm{Ber}(z)}\left(\exists i \in [k] : p_i = 1\right)
    = 1-(1-z)^k.
